        <mxCell id="OPEN" value="&lt;b&gt;OPEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style='margin:3px 0'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10px'&gt;entry / assemble the evidence trail from the event log;&lt;br&gt;set trigger type, priority, reason; assign a moderator&lt;br&gt;of the community (Admin if none, D6 2a); notify&lt;br&gt;trigger_attached / reuse this case, no duplicate (D6 1b)&lt;br&gt;escalated_to_admin [unresolvable, or a moderator is&lt;br&gt;a party] / assignee := Admin (I4 3a, 3b) &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#0A7A36'&gt;C05&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2B3A4A;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1D1D1D;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="UNDECIDED">
