        <mxCell id="v15" value="&lt;b&gt;Why possession is recorded (ADR-0009, review action DM14).&lt;/b&gt; A dispute can be raised before handover, while the item is out, or during the return. Sending every resolved dispute to COMPLETED would record a return that never happened and release the dates of an item that is not back. The moderator therefore records where the item is, and only the answers that fit the stored previous state are offered." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFDF2;strokeColor=#B8A660;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#33404D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="600" y="840" width="560" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v16" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#00796B'&gt;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9658;&lt;/span&gt; party &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#7B3FA0'&gt;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9658;&lt;/span&gt; moderator or admin &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#5F6B76'&gt;- - &amp;#9658;&lt;/span&gt; system or completion&lt;br&gt;event [guard] / effect; bold border = final state; &lt;font color='#0A7A36'&gt;&lt;b&gt;green ID&lt;/b&gt; = added or changed in iteration 2 (C05; C06 records possession, ADR-0009)&lt;/font&gt;. Case actions are not lifecycle events: each is an audit_log entry and the case row keeps the status. The decision itself becomes one lifecycle event." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#33404D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="840" width="520" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
